              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As we all know, the Golden Hour is notorious for its many appalling entertainment facilities, with the Golden Capsule Machine being one of the worst. My companions and I will start a challenge of inserting 50 consecutively into the machine and record the outcome of each game to reveal The Family's conspiracy regarding the odds of winning the prize."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "1st Trial"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Method: Insert 1 Aideen Token normally."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Outcome:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Comment: I suspect they have lowered the odds of winning the prize again."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
